Package: unim
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: im-config, dbus
Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-unim
Description: Korean Input Method Engine
 UNIM is a modular Korean Input Method Engine with 2-bul and 3-bul layout
 support, featuring automatic Korean/English typo correction.
 .
 This package provides the complete UNIM stack:
  * Core daemon (unim-daemon) with D-Bus session activation
  * XIM and Wayland protocol servers
  * C-API library (libunim_capi) and CLI tools
  * GTK3 and GTK4 input method modules
  * Qt5 and Qt6 platform input context plugins
  * GTK4/libadwaita settings GUI (unim-gui-gtk)
  * Qt6/QML alternative GUI (unim-gui-qt)
  * im-config integration

Package: gnome-shell-extension-unim
Architecture: all
Depends: unim (>= ${source:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
         gnome-shell
Description: GNOME Shell extension for UNIM
 GNOME Shell extension providing native indicator integration, hotkey
 management, and per-application input method state for the UNIM Korean
 Input Method Engine.
